    "codeql_raw_query": "/**\n * @name Code injection via eval/exec/compile\n * @description Using eval, exec, or compile with untrusted input can lead to arbitrary code execution.\n *              This query identifies all calls to these functions to audit them.\n * @kind problem\n * @problem.severity warning\n * @id py/code-injection-audit\n * @tags security\n *        external/cwe/cwe-094\n *        external/cwe/cwe-095\n */\n\nimport python\nimport semmle.python.ApiGraphs\n\nfrom DataFlow::CallCfgNode call\nwhere\n  call = API::builtin([\"exec\", \"eval\", \"compile\"]).getACall()\nselect call, \"Call to dynamic execution function.\"\n",
    "hypothesis": "The package might generate code dynamically using exec/eval/compile. If user inputs (like attribute names) are not sanitized, this could allow code injection.",
